al minigames, she'll bump into trees to smell them, collect beads of condensation from iced tea, and even listen to the sounds of neighbors' toilets! These sensations weave the fabric of her life in the <i>danchi</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107530/extras/ff6266a281c423896601b343a6d9a7ff.poster.avif?t=1754266350\" width=616 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107530/extras/ff6266a281c423896601b343a6d9a7ff.webm?t=1754266350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107530/extras/ff6266a281c423896601b343a6d9a7ff.mp4?t=1754266350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet The Cast!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107530/extras/db1be2f6387a6d9462e935e3015988a2.avif?t=1754266350\" width=304 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b2Hoshino Kanaoka</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively 6th grader! Her dad's job took them both to the USA for 5 years, but recently, they've returned to her hometown of Another Danchi to live with her grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107530/extras/487d971963029244e33e152860e37efc.avif?t=1754266350\" width=304 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b2Kimiko Kanaoka (Hoshino's Grandma)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Former kindergarten principal, and Hoshino's beloved grandma! She's been living with dementia for a few years, but back when she was healthy, Hoshino and Rio learned all sorts of things from her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=