    "reviews": "\u201cThis game uses its unique charm to bring out the wonder of everyday life. [...] After my time playing, I felt the world taking on a deeper beauty.\u201d<br>Game*Spark<br><br>\u201cDanchi Days is a bit of an odd game, but [...] an endlessly charming one.\u201d<br>Inverse<br><br>\u201cDanchi Days tells a heartbreaking tale, but the cheery visuals and message of hope have me feeling inspired.\u201d<br>Vice<br>",
